<section class="section">
  <h2>Stay connected with the school</h2>
  <p>
    Find important school information and family resources all in one
    convenient place — visit the Saguaro Creek website, review arrival and
    dismissal schedules, learn about before- and after-school care, access
    transportation information, and view the VUSD calendar.
  </p>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li><a href="https://scs.vailschooldistrict.org/"><strong>Saguaro Creek school website</strong></a> — news, staff directory, and school information.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.vailschooldistrict.org/o/vsd/page/2025-2026-student-calendars"><strong>VUSD student calendars</strong></a> — school year calendars for the district.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.vailschooldistrict.org/page/transportation"><strong>Transportation</strong></a> — bus routes and transportation information.</li>
    <li><a href="https://cp.vailschooldistrict.org/page/before-and-after-care/"><strong>Before &amp; after school care</strong></a> — VUSD Community Programs child care.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>School year essentials</h2>
  <p>
    Access the everyday tools and community resources your family may need
    throughout the school year — check student information in PowerSchool,
    manage meal accounts through MyMealTime, explore VUSD services and
    Community Programs, and connect with your local public library.
  </p>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li><a href="https://ps.vail.k12.az.us/public/"><strong>PowerSchool</strong></a> — grades, attendance, and student information.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.mymealtime.com/"><strong>MyMealTime</strong></a> — manage student meal accounts.</li>
    <li><a href="https://secure.caredox.com/c/accounts/login"><strong>CareDox</strong></a> — student health records.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.vailschooldistrict.org/"><strong>Vail School District</strong></a> — district news and services.</li>
    <li><a href="https://cp.vailschooldistrict.org/page/saguaro-creek-k8-school/"><strong>VUSD Community Programs at Saguaro Creek</strong></a> — enrichment and community programs at our school.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.library.pima.gov/locations/SLIB/"><strong>Pima County Public Library</strong></a> — your local public library.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
